S106 src=cite kid=K002 lic=-1 p=[-1,-1,-1] depth=1 live t=-1 r=0 taint=0: Real-number arithmetic: addition and multiplication are commutative and associative; multiplication distributes over addition; 0 is the additive identity and 1 is the multiplicative identity; every real number x has an additive inverse -x; every nonzero real number x has a multiplicative inverse 1/x.
